{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rhythm game that lets you play the way you want. You can dive straight into the built-in set of songs, which ease you in with a gentle learning curve. Or you can load up your own music and see the game transform it into a unique level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any audio file from your computer, and the game will generate a chart based on the beat and rhythm. If the track has album art, the game also creates a matching colour scheme, so every song feels like it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/extras/58672db275e00c4cd53171b5fc41d734.poster.avif?t=1758415863\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/extras/58672db275e00c4cd53171b5fc41d734.webm?t=1758415863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any song from your computer (.mp3, .ogg, .wav)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural chart generation based on rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Album art\u2013based colours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20136 lane gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note types: taps, holds, mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable note speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom lane count</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifiers: Hidden Notes, Instant Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No-Fail mode and Practice Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official song list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game library management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart packaging for backup/sharing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013260?t=1758415863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/bf248ece54cc069751efa60e16f9c5c32f50ddda/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758415863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/64f607f4e05939378e53baa2ba50ec3fa10e6370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758415863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/64f607f4e05939378e53baa2ba50ec3fa10e6370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758415863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rhythm game that lets you play the way you want. You can dive straight into the built-in set of songs, which ease you in with a gentle learning curve. Or you can load up your own music and see the game transform it into a unique level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any audio file from your computer, and the game will generate a chart based on the beat and rhythm. If the track has album art, the game also creates a matching colour scheme, so every song feels like it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/extras/58672db275e00c4cd53171b5fc41d734.poster.avif?t=1758415863\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013260/extras/